Value DEST (\S+)
Value OWNER (\S+)
Value PRI (\S+)
Value METRIC (\S+)
Value FLAGS (\S*)
Value GATEWAY (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^Headers:
  ^Codes
  ^Flag\s+codes
  ^\s*Dest -> Entries
  ^\s*$$
  ^.* -> Start

Entries
  ^\s*${DEST}\s+${OWNER}\s+${PRI}\s+${METRIC}\s+${FLAGS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+${GATEWAY},${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^\S+\s*#\s*$$ -> End
  ^.*#\s*$$ -> End
  ^.* -> Entries
